  "body": "SchemaCrawler  release at last commit e9b682b945a6c4a9305b4effe1c748d0324fa0fe\nSee the change history at https://www.schemacrawler.com/changes-report.html\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* Bump com.fasterxml.woodstox:woodstox-core from 7.2.2 to 7.3.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2521\n* Bump chainguard-dev/actions/setup-gitsign from 1.6.37 to 1.6.40 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2522\n* Use catalog projections instead of reducing catalogs by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2524\n* Prepare for the next release by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2525\n* Change case using root locale by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2527\n* Bump github/codeql-action from 4.38.2 to 4.38.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2526\n* Update javadocs by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2528\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/compare/v17.15.7...v17.16.0",
